Package: jarvis-files
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ file tools (MCP server)
 Finds, reads and lists files in your home folder, and moves, copies,
 renames, makes folders, trashes and restores them for the Jarvis agent
 (freedesktop.org trash). Every change returns a journal id it can be undone
 with.
